{"path":"documentation/tutorial/14-composition/04-optional-slots/app-b/Comment.svelte","source_sha256":"bcca158d19bba3db6b4f1b86616fee43e5446df61d3ae434c7431c5417811984","utf8":"<script>\n\texport let name;\n\texport let postedAt;\n\n\t$: avatar = `https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=${name.replace(\n\t\t/ /g,\n\t\t'+'\n\t)}&rounded=true&background=ff3e00&color=fff&bold=true`;\n</script>\n\n<article>\n\t<div class=\"header\">\n\t\t<img src={avatar} alt=\"\" height=\"32\" width=\"32\" />\n\t\t<div class=\"details\">\n\t\t\t<h4>{name}</h4>\n\t\t\t<time datetime={postedAt.toISOString()}>{postedAt.toLocaleDateString()}</time>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"body\">\n\t\t<slot />\n\t</div>\n</article>\n\n<style>\n\tarticle {\n\t\tbackground-color: #fff;\n\t\tborder: 1px #ccc solid;\n\t\tborder-radius: 4px;\n\t\tpadding: 1rem;\n\t}\n\n\t.header {\n\t\talign-items: center;\n\t\tdisplay: flex;\n\t}\n\n\t.details {\n\t\tflex: 1 1 auto;\n\t\tmargin-left: 0.5rem;\n\t}\n\n\th4 {\n\t\tmargin: 0;\n\t}\n\n\ttime {\n\t\tcolor: #777;\n\t\tfont-size: 0.75rem;\n\t\ttext-decoration: underline;\n\t}\n\n\t.body {\n\t\tmargin-top: 0.5rem;\n\t}\n\n\t.body :global(p) {\n\t\tmargin: 0;\n\t}\n</style>\n"}